# Copy to `.env.local` for a local run against your own Supabase project.
#
# For real builds these are EAS secrets, not a file — see docs/backend.md.
# Both must be set or the app runs device-only, exactly as it does today.
#
# The `anon` key is safe to ship: it identifies the project and grants nothing.
# Row Level Security in supabase/schema.sql is what grants things. The
# `service_role` key bypasses all of it and must never appear here.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
